---- MODULE History ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from history.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart history.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES summary, history
vars == <<summary, history>>

\* Region Summary
summaryStates == {"SummaryError", "SummaryLoading", "SummaryReady", "SummaryRetired"}
\* Region History
historyStates == {"Collapsed", "ContinuationError", "Continuing", "HistoryError", "HistoryLoading", "HistoryReady", "HistoryRetired"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ summary \in summaryStates
    /\ history \in historyStates

Init ==
    /\ summary = "SummaryLoading"
    /\ history = "Collapsed"

\* summary arrives
SummaryArrives ==
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryLoading" /\ summary' = "SummaryReady")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<history>>

\* summary fails
SummaryFails ==
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryLoading" /\ summary' = "SummaryError")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<history>>

\* retry summary
RetrySummary ==
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryError" /\ summary' = "SummaryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<history>>

\* refresh source
RefreshSource ==
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryReady" /\ summary' = "SummaryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<history>>

\* leave deal
LeaveDeal ==
    /\ (summary \in {"SummaryReady", "SummaryError"} \/ history \in {"HistoryLoading", "Continuing", "HistoryError", "ContinuationError", "Collapsed"})
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryReady" /\ summary' = "SummaryRetired")
       \/ (summary = "SummaryError" /\ summary' = "SummaryRetired")
       \/ (summary \notin {"SummaryReady", "SummaryError"} /\ UNCHANGED summary)
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryLoading" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history = "Continuing" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history = "HistoryError" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history = "ContinuationError" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history = "Collapsed" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history \notin {"HistoryLoading", "Continuing", "HistoryError", "ContinuationError", "Collapsed"} /\ UNCHANGED history)

\* lose session
LoseSession ==
    /\ (summary \in {"SummaryLoading"} \/ history \in {"HistoryReady"})
    /\ \/ (summary = "SummaryLoading" /\ summary' = "SummaryRetired")
       \/ (summary \notin {"SummaryLoading"} /\ UNCHANGED summary)
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryReady" /\ history' = "HistoryRetired")
       \/ (history \notin {"HistoryReady"} /\ UNCHANGED history)

\* expand history
ExpandHistory ==
    /\ \/ (history = "Collapsed" /\ history' = "HistoryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* first page arrives
FirstPageArrives ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryLoading" /\ history' = "HistoryReady")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* first page fails
FirstPageFails ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryLoading" /\ history' = "HistoryError")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* retry history
RetryHistory ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryError" /\ history' = "HistoryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* load older
LoadOlder ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryReady" /\ history' = "Continuing")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* next page arrives
NextPageArrives ==
    /\ \/ (history = "Continuing" /\ history' = "HistoryReady")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* ordinary failure keeps rows
OrdinaryFailureKeepsRows ==
    /\ \/ (history = "Continuing" /\ history' = "ContinuationError")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* retry older
RetryOlder ==
    /\ \/ (history = "ContinuationError" /\ history' = "Continuing")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* stale cursor replaces pages
StaleCursorReplacesPages ==
    /\ \/ (history = "Continuing" /\ history' = "HistoryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* refresh replaces revision
RefreshReplacesRevision ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryReady" /\ history' = "HistoryLoading")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* unchanged source keeps pages
UnchangedSourceKeepsPages ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryReady" /\ history' = "HistoryReady")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* changed source clears cached pages
ChangedSourceClearsCachedPages ==
    /\ \/ (history = "Collapsed" /\ history' = "Collapsed")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

\* collapse returns focus
CollapseReturnsFocus ==
    /\ \/ (history = "HistoryReady" /\ history' = "Collapsed")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<summary>>

Next == SummaryArrives \/ SummaryFails \/ RetrySummary \/ RefreshSource \/ LeaveDeal \/ LoseSession \/ ExpandHistory \/ FirstPageArrives \/ FirstPageFails \/ RetryHistory \/ LoadOlder \/ NextPageArrives \/ OrdinaryFailureKeepsRows \/ RetryOlder \/ StaleCursorReplacesPages \/ RefreshReplacesRevision \/ UnchangedSourceKeepsPages \/ ChangedSourceClearsCachedPages \/ CollapseReturnsFocus

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

